    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Maar Ɣocä kɛnɛ ciekdɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial Ɣocä jiök i̱, “Wër nyɔk ciekdu kɛ mi nhɔki jɛ, cäŋ ni mɔ nhɔkɛ nɛy kɔ̱kiɛn ɔ, kä ɛ ler. Nhɔk ɛ ce̱tkɛ mɔ nhɔakä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ɔ, kä guɔ̱ɔ̱rkɛ ni kuth ti guäy, kä käm kɛn nikɛ luurikiɛn.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cua̱ ciekdä nyɔk kɛ kök kɛ yio̱w da̱ŋ wäl dhieec, kɛ cuali bɛɛl da̱ŋ diɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua̱ jɛ jiök i̱, “Bi cieŋ ala ciekdä kɛ ni̱n ti ŋuan, kä /ci rɔ bi nyɔk kɛ leer kɛ wut dɔ̱diɛn, kä bä cieŋ ala cɔwdu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl bikɛ cieŋ a thil bööth kiɛ kuäär kɛ pëk mi baar, kä bikɛ thil luuri kiɛ yi̱kni kiɛ nyin palä ti kɔ̱kiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kɔrɛ bi ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɔ̱ ku riet Kuoth Nhial in la Kuothdiɛn, kä ba Dee-bid kuääriɛn guɔ̱r ɛ kɛn. Kä bikɛ cu ben kä Kuoth Nhial kɛ luth mi di̱i̱t kɛ kui̱ puthädɛ cäŋ guutdä ɣɔaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
